/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The objective of a data privacy program is to ensure that an organization responsibly manages personal data in compliance with legal and regulatory requirements, thereby safeguarding the rights and privacy of individuals while minimizing risks associated with data breaches and misuse.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [0]
>>
