>>
endobj
180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (An e-commerce company implementing a data privacy program would ensure that customers' personal and transactional information, such as names, addresses, payment details, and purchase histories, is collected only for processing orders and enhancing customer experience, securely stored with encryption, and accessible only to authorized personnel. This program would help the company comply with regulations like GDPR, DPDP, or CCPA, maintaining customer trust and avoiding legal penalties by providing mechanisms for customers to access, correct, and delete their personal data.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
