/ActualText (A privacy notice is an outward-facing document that describes an organization's data handling practices to individuals whose personal data is being collected. It serves as a key transparency mechanism, providing clear and understandable information about how the organization processes, uses, stores, and protects personal data. Key elements typically included in a privacy notice are:)
